From: tyn-patches <tyn-patches@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 00:13:02 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] tyn: sg-pc MOVIE LIBRARY (10:20, 0x436480 / 0x436540 /
 0x436170); CG / SOUND LIBRARY leave at once

The EXTRA libraries had no screens in sg-pc, so the script waited on an
invisible menu and the title could not be used any more. The movie library
is ported from Game.exe (entries, unlock flags, mouse areas of table
0x52b478, preview cells, the chosen movie over the library at layer 3000).
The CG and sound libraries are not ported yet: they answer like the player
leaving, so the script goes back to the title.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

